  title: Nifty Club
  sections:
  - heading: Welcome to Nifty Club
    text: In order to run this project, you will need a running DarkRift2 server instance.
    text2:
    linkText: 
    url:
  - heading: DarkRift2 Server
    text: Includes the executable for the server. Executable can be found by using menu
    text2: <color=orange>Tools > Nifty League > Open Folder DarkRift Console</color>
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: DarkRift2 Plugins
    text: Includes plugins project that can be built to generate DLLs we use with Dark Rift executable. Plugins folder can be found by using menu
    text2: <color=orange>Tools > Nifty League > Open Folder DarkRift Plugins</color>
